  "Posted a 'Starting (8)' section: ABS/VDP (Agents Of Black Sun / Vengeance Of The Dark Prince), Coruscant, Coruscant Docking Bay, Prince Xizor, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, All Wrapped Up, Mobilization Points; all count toward the 60. Coruscant Docking Bay and Prince Xizor are posted again in the Locations/Characters sections (two copies each, kept as posted). Total is 60.",
  "Starting effect left empty: three Effects start (via Prepared Defenses) and the post names none as the starting Effect.",
  "Posted 'Coruscant' dested Coruscant (Dark) (Special Edition), the Dark system printing of the era; 'Coruscant Docking Bay' = Coruscant: Docking Bay (Special Edition, Dark).",
  "Posted 'Boba Fett' (no set given) dested Boba Fett (Special Edition) by default; could be the Cloud City Boba Fett.",
  "Posted 'Judo Kast' dested Jodo Kast.",
  "Secret Plans is the 2001 Special Edition Effect (not the Reflections III Defensive Shield).",
  "Tatooine Docking Bay 94 and Vibro-Ax use the Dark printings.",
  "The post is a revised repost of the author's Black Sun deck from about a month earlier."
